      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kermit%2C_West_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "While coal is well known in the region, the mountains around Kermit also contained valuable natural gas deposits.",
